  "job_B1.4.28_20251001_193238": {
    "text": "\u00de\u00e6t we on worulde wi\u00f0\u00e6ftan us l\u00e6fa\u00f0, & eall \u00fe\u00e6t leofre on \u00feysum middanearde is, \u00feeah hit huru w\u00e6re\nWa \u00feonne \u00feam menn \u00fee her on \u00feisum life geearna\u00f0 him hellewite.\nUton nu for\u00fei, leofan gebro\u00f0ra, andettan ure misd\u00e6da & synna \u00fea hwile \u00fee we magon & moton, & betan\nWitodlice ne mot se deofol \u00e6nigum menn \u00fee hine sylfne her on \u00feisum life sylfwilles to his scrifte for\nWe wylla\u00f0 eow secgan sume bysne nu be \u00feysum, \u00fe\u00e6t ge beon \u00fee gewissran be eowre agenre \u00feearfe.\nOn \u00fe\u00e6re halgan bec \u00fee hatte uita patrum us seg\u00f0 swutellice \u00fe\u00e6t sum munuc on westene ab\u00e6d \u00e6t his\n\u00d0a nolde se h\u00e6lend him \u00fe\u00e6s forwyrnan, ac him w\u00e6s gewissod \u00fe\u00e6t he gewende to anre byrig weard,\nWi\u00f0utan \u00fe\u00e6re byrig w\u00e6s on sunderlicre wununge sum namcu\u00f0 wer sittende, swylce he ancersetla\nSe l\u00e6g \u00fea swi\u00fee seoc unges\u00e6liglice, andbidigende dea\u00fees mid eallum his synna.\n\u00d0a geseah se munuc \u00fee of \u00feam westene \u00fe\u00e6t an egeslic deofol of \u00fe\u00e6re deorcan helle com to \u00feam seocan\n\u00d0a com stefen ufan fram \u00feam \u00e6lmihtigan Gode to \u00feam sweartan deofle, \u00feuss secgende him to: Swa\n\u00d0a sette se deofol sona his force swylce glowende isen into his heortan & hine lange drehte mid licum\n\u00c6fter \u00feisum eode se ylca fores\u00e6da munuc oninnan \u00fe\u00e6re byrig, & he efne \u00fea funde \u00e6nne seocne mann\nGodes englas him to, Michael & Gabriel, swa swa God \u00fe\u00e6t hi \u00fe\u00e6s mannes sawle sceoldon underfon, &\n\u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe Gabrihel to Michaele, genim \u00feas sawle ardlice \u00fee to, & uton si\u00feian upp.\nMichael him andwyrde, us is beboden fram \u00feam \u00e6lmihtigan Gode \u00fe\u00e6t we butan sarnysse \u00feas sawle\n\u00d0a clypode Michael upp mid mycelre stefne & cw\u00e6\u00fe: hu wylt \u00feu, leof Drihten, embe \u00feas sawle?\nHeo nele us ge\u00feafian \u00fe\u00e6t heo ut gewite.\nHim com \u00fea andswaru \u00feuss secgende of heofonum: ic asende nu rihtes \u00fe\u00e6re sawle togeanes Dauid mid\nHi comon \u00fea ealle to \u00fe\u00e6re anre sawle swy\u00fee myrige singende, & heo swa gewat ut of \u00feam lichaman\nUs seg\u00f0 seo ylce boc \u00fe\u00e6t sum o\u00f0er munuc hwilon, swi\u00fee ge\u00feogen mann on mihte & on gearum, com\n\u00d0a ges\u00e6t he swa \u00e6t anes rices mannes geate, se l\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6r on for\u00f0si\u00fee, & se munuc \u00fea beheold, for \u00fean\n\u00d0a geseah se munuc mycelne getruman, swylce ridendra manna mid swy\u00fee re\u00feum anginne, ansynes\nLihton \u00fea ealle & inn stopon caflice, & \u00e6lc h\u00e6fde isenne sagol on fyres gelicnysse, & stodon \u00feam\nHe clypode mycelre angsumnesse, Drihten, gehelp min.\nDeoflu: Eart \u00feu nu gemyndig \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6lmihtigan Godes \u00feonne \u00fein sunne \u00fee is forsworcen mid ealle?\nHwi noldest \u00feu \u00fea hwile \u00fee \u00f0u h\u00e6fdest \u00e6nig \u00fee he symle o\u00f0 his ende.\nBa\u00f0 swylce forebysne gehyred ge; his agene; sece to scrifte, \u00fe\u00e6t him wyr\u00f0e God milde, for \u00feam swa\nHit his eall so\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t we gyt secgan wylla\u00f0: \u00f0am \u00fee nele her nu his synna andettan his scrifte, & betan\nEalle \u00fea synna \u00fee we her wyrcea\u00f0, ealle hi beo\u00f0 eft on us sylfum gesewene & geopenode, buton hi \u00e6r",
